s:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{c}^{4}-19{c}^{2}-7 & =6{({c}^{2})}^{2}-19{c}^{2}-7 \\\\  & =6{z}^{2}-19z-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can factor the quadratic, and then rewrite the final expression in terms of $c:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{z}^{2}-19z-7 & =(3z+1)(2z-7) \\\\  & =(3{c}^{2}+1)(2{c}^{2}-7)\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530437 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138412 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e836ca22-abd9-5812-bbf7-3b057e3d6c4b" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring Biquadratic Expressions as Quadratic Trinomials With Leading Coefficients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0cfc2107-cc92-5d72-89a4-f31d501a40f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3{h}^{2}-1)({h}^{2}+5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529604} {:answer/id #uuid "69539f7c-1177-56a1-8dfd-b85eef22e6c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3h+2)({h}^{2}-5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529848} {:answer/id #uuid "7d143340-5ed9-5215-a4b7-0d3abb3d495f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3{h}^{2}+2)({h}^{2}-5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529895} {:answer/id #uuid "d63d1e4f-5f61-5df5-8fac-02c6b52874fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3{h}^{2}+1)(h-5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530114} {:answer/id #uuid "fd98310d-5700-5e62-93e0-1154f892edda" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3({h}^{2}+2)({h}^{2}-5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530209}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7d143340-5ed9-5215-a4b7-0d3abb3d495f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3{h}^{2}+2)({h}^{2}-5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529895} :answer-field/id #uuid "339e8817-6619-5b0c-a131-7ab68a02f3a3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1